feat(catalog-sku): the sku domain joins — three services, 22 RPCs, the stock-adjustment face included

Three services in one drop: SkuService (the sellable unit — product
link, code, stock quantity, plus AdjustStock with the negative-stock
guard), SkuPriceService (per-currency prices carrying the exact
amount string the reference stores — no float round-trips), and
SkuAttributeCombinationService (the sku-attribute-value links). The
golden DDL grows the three tables (prices and combinations cascade
off the sku), and the bootstrap gate grew with them.

Known gap, recorded: the AdjustStock route is a Go-style colon verb
(`/admin/v1/mall/skus/{id}:adjust-stock`, no body declaration — the
delta rides the query string); the gen-http route table handles the
spelling but the axum 0.8 mount answers 405 on the POST — the
framework's route-table verb handling is the follow-up. The other 21
RPCs of the domain answer live.

verified: admin create sku + price (CNY 5900), the anonymous sku list
reading both back with stockQty, the cart add consuming the new sku —
the storefront sellable chain complete end to end
